Vertex Procedures
computing the angle presumes the angle is always less than 180 degrees
1-cos(a) = 0 for 0", 1 for 90", and 2 for 180"
Polygon Procedures
THEN G3dVector.FrontFacingWithPerspective[f.normal, f.center, inverse]
